#lang beagle/scriptc
;; RATCHET FIXTURE — D9-topform-leaks-structs.
;; A typed top-level `def` is a target-neutral form ScriptC can host, but the
;; validator rejects it by printing the raw def-form struct at the user.
;; reject row: the diagnostic golden is pinned AND required to name `def`, so
;; the struct leak is a :bug ratchet, not a silent reject-match pass.
(ns conformance.sc-untyped-def)

(def answer: Int 42)

(println answer)
